# 2026-08-11 18:09:37.923578
+The generator script build_nb.py is broken. It emitted two markdown cells and zero code cells. Two root causes, both must be fixed.
+
+ROOT CAUSE ONE, a category error. The script hunts for the section delimiters by walking the parsed syntax tree looking for string expression nodes. That can never work: the delimiters are ordinary Python comments, and comments are discarded by the parser before a tree is ever built, so they are simply not present in it. The tree is the wrong place to look. Find them instead by iterating over the raw text lines of the source file with their one-based line numbers, and selecting those whose stripped text opens with a hash character followed by the word SECTION. For each match record its line number and the title, which is the remainder of that line after the hash. Keep using the syntax tree for the functions, which genuinely are tree nodes.
+
+ROOT CAUSE TWO, no code cells at all are produced, meaning the loop over top level function definitions is never finding any or never appending. Iterate the parsed module's top level body list, keep the entries that are function definitions, and for each one obtain its exact original source text using the standard library helper that extracts a node's source segment. A function belongs to the last section whose recorded line number is smaller than the function's own starting line number, and to section one if there is no such section.
+
+Also replace the deprecated string node checks that are emitting warnings; obtain a function's documentation text with the dedicated standard library helper rather than by inspecting node internals.
+
+Everything else about the required notebook structure stays exactly as previously specified: the opening markdown cell with the top level heading and the module documentation text, a second level heading markdown cell at each section boundary, a third level heading plus documentation markdown cell before every function's code cell, an invocation appended inside the code cell for the parameterless functions of the later sections but not for section one, a driver cell after the section one functions built from the dedented leading portion of the main guard body up to the first call to a demo prefixed function, and no cell for the guard itself. Keep printing the summary counts.

