# 2026-08-11 18:17:50.129811
+build_nb.py raises IndexError because a block that ended up with no lines at all reaches the classification step, which immediately indexes its first line. Trimming trailing blank lines can empty a block completely, and the very first block can also start out empty.
+
+Fix: immediately after the splitting step finishes and before anything classifies or emits, discard every block that has no lines left, or whose lines are all blank. Only non empty blocks proceed. Make no other change to the script's logic or output format.

