# 2026-08-11 18:55:58.530940
+Two defects in build_nb.py. Fix both, change nothing else.
+
+DEFECT ONE, fatal. When the lines of a chunk are joined back into the text for a code cell, they are being concatenated with no separator, so the whole chunk collapses onto a single physical line. Because that line starts with a hash, the entire cell becomes one comment and executes as nothing at all. The lines must be rejoined with a newline character between them so the original line structure is restored exactly. Check every place a list of lines becomes a string.
