# 2026-08-11 19:54:26.695707
+Write a one-shot Python 3 script that appends a new section to the end of /mnt/data/gitfiles/CLAUDE.md. It must open that file in append mode and write the section; it must not read, rewrite or otherwise disturb the existing contents. Hold the section text in a single triple quoted string constant and write it in one call. Print a confirmation of how many characters were appended.
+
+The section is markdown. It opens with a blank line, then a second level heading reading: Benchmarked Findings — RTX 2060 6 GB (2026-08-11). Under it a one line note saying it supplements, and does not replace, the June findings above. Then a bulleted list. Each bullet starts with a short bold lead-in phrase followed by the detail, matching the style of the June bullets already in that file.
+
+The bullets, in order:
+
+Flash attention plus q8_0 KV cache now set in the Ollama systemd unit. Cut the 7B q3_K_M footprint at 10k context from 4.91 GB to 4.46 GB, moving it from 91 percent resident with 447 MB spilling to 100 percent with all 29 layers on GPU. Negligible quality cost.
+
+One model at a time. The unit now sets a single loaded model and a 30 second idle unload, replacing defaults that allowed several models resident with a five minute window.
+
+Killing aider does not stop the runner. The Ollama server keeps generating and keeps the model loaded, so interrupted runs strand VRAM. Two stranded runners once held 5.4 GB, causing a benchmark to offload one layer and report a meaningless 7.4 tok/s.
+
+Diff format is now the default for editing existing files. A one line change in a 395 line file took 25s and 358 output tokens and touched nothing else. Whole format repeatedly deleted unrelated functions because it regenerates every line each time.
+
+Never pair diff format with the 3B. It ran 400s on the same file and produced no edit.
+
+qwen3.5:4b is a trap on this card. A 3.4 GB download but a 6.51 GB loaded footprint, 72 percent resident at 27.7 tok/s, about half the 7B q3 speed, and it returned nothing through aider in ten minutes. Judge a model by loaded footprint, never download size.
+
+Naming and forbidding beats restating. When a small model keeps emitting the same wrong structure, restating the goal fails. Name the construct it reaches for and forbid it. Saying the loop keyword must not appear, and that six sequential statements were required, fixed on the first try what four goal restatements had not.
+
+Invocation hygiene. Always pipe aider output through tee into a log rather than a trailing pager, since a pager buffers and a killed run leaves no diagnostic; always pass an explicit time limit.

